{"title":"1.2.9.2","sourceTitle":"1.2.9.2/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/1.2.9.2/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"1.2.9.2 (100% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/1.2.9.2\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"1.2.9.2 (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li></ul></div>\n<div style=\"margin: 0 1em 1em; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; float:right; width:300px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);&#125;&#125;\">\n<big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">1.2.9.2/pt-br</span></b></big></th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"margin:auto; text-align:center;\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%\"><b>Release date</b></td><td>January 24, 2017</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%); height: 1.5em; text-align:center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb; margin:auto;\">Version chronology</span></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center\"><table style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%\"><a href=\"/1.1.0\" title=\"1.1.0\"><span style=\"margin-right:-0.35em\">◄</span>◄ 1.1.0</a><br /><a href=\"/1.2.8\" title=\"1.2.8\">◄ 1.2.8</a></td><td><a href=\"/1.3.0\" title=\"1.3.0\">1.3.0 ►</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n<b>1.2.9.2</b>, é um hotfix<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, apresentando uma adição de API, algumas correções de falhas e muito mais.\n</p><p><span id=\"Features\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Características\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Características</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Ajustes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ajustes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Correções\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Correções</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Caracter.C3.ADsticas\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Características\">Características</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Adicionada uma chamada de API para examinar todos os manipuladores de geração mundial registrados. Deve permitir a geração de mundos totalmente personalizados, limpando todos os manipuladores.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Tweaks\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ajustes\">Ajustes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Alguns métodos de API agora são getters em vez de métodos.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Fixes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Corre.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Correções\">Correções</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Corrigido o mapeamento de teclado perdido após cada atualização.</li>\n<li>Corrigidos minérios que não eram consumidos após serem fundidos na fogueira.</li>\n<li>Corrigido um travamento do cliente ao quebrar blocos em determinadas situações.</li>\n<li>Corrigida uma falha do cliente ao abrir o inventário do baú em determinadas situações.</li>\n<li>Corrigida uma falha do cliente ao tentar se conectar a um servidor em determinadas situações (relacionadas a pilhas de lingotes).</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n<span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/blog.html/news/hotfix-v1292-r72/\">\" Hotfix (1.2.9.2) \"</a>– Vintagestory.at, January 242, 2017\n</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115544\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 205/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7222/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip 